            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKkgd7o7PoJX17xZW5DlWxevgKf\">The diagram illustrates the process of extracting essential oils from aromatic plants to produce perfume through a distillation process.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13843,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 617,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M7cXd0CYOomciCx1rPjledwgg5d\">The process consists of four stages, beginning with heating water to generate steam and ending with the separation of two final products: essential oil and aromatic water (hydrolat).</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13843,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 618,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bwvgdl6Nao0efaxzwWNlHSiogUd\">The process starts when fire is applied to heat water in a container, which then generates steam. This steam passes through a chamber filled with aromatic plants, where it carries aromatic compounds from the plants along with it. At this stage, it forms a mixture of steam and oil vapor<strong> </strong>that flows into the condenser.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13843,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 619,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X7fBdNSVOonSVDxtHMHlItU8g4b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-R7Q9dn91Mor5zaxmEJ4l0S3Mgv2\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R7Q9dn91Mor5zaxmEJ4l0S3Mgv2\">In the latter stages, the aromatic steam vapor moves through a condensation chamber where cold water is pumped in to cool the vapor, while hot water exits as part of the cooling process. The condensed liquid, which is a mixture of water and essential oil, flows into a separation vessel. This specialized separator uses a distinctive Y-shaped design to divide the mixture, where the essential oil is extracted through one outlet, while the hydrolat (aromatic water) is collected through another as the final product.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
